Subject: [PROPOSED] PMOS routing integration for ACPM

This patch is NOT applied. PMOS routing is handled entirely within
pmos.html and pmos.js. No changes to ACPM core routing (main.js,
dashboard.html, workspace.html) are needed.

PMOS page identifier: window.ACPM_PAGE = 'pmos' (set in pmos.html)
ACPM core page identifiers:
- 'login' (login.html)
- 'dashboard' (dashboard.html)
- 'workspace' (workspace.html)

The PMOS page loads auth.js and main.js for shared authentication and
user state, but does not use ACPM's Hub, Workspace, or module routing.

No integration changes needed between PMOS routing and ACPM core routing.
